- execute_schedule_dispatch: parameters ?candidate - schedule_candidate, ?vehicle_unit, ?dispatch_slot.
Precondition: (dispatch_allocated ?candidate) & (candidate_vehicle_linked ?candidate ?vehicle_unit) & (candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot) & (not (dispatched ?candidate)).
Effect: (dispatched ?candidate), (vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit), (dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot).

- execute_origin_dispatch: parameters ?origin_availability - origin_candidate_availability, ?vehicle_unit, ?dispatch_slot.
Precondition: (dispatch_allocated ?origin_availability) & (candidate_vehicle_linked ?origin_availability ?vehicle_unit) & (candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?origin_availability ?dispatch_slot) & (not (dispatched ?origin_availability)).
Effect: (dispatched ?origin_availability), (vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit), (dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot).

- execute_destination_dispatch: similar for destination_availability.

